   "text": "Watch only your immediate predecessor - and a release under a 10,000-deep queue wakes ONE waiter",
   "originalText": "Watch only your immediate predecessor - and a release under a 10,000-deep queue wakes ONE waiter",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 3,
